==Russian==

===Etymology===
{{inh+|ru|sla-pro|*za}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{ru-IPA}}
* {{ru-IPA|zɐ}} {{q|before a stressed syllable}}
* {{ru-IPA|за́-}} {{q|when stressed}}

===Prefix===
{{head|ru|prefix|cat2=verbal prefixes}}

# {{lb|ru|used with verbs}} [[behind]], [[beyond]]
#: {{prefex|ru|-йти́|g1=impf|t1=to go|зайти́|g2=pf|t2=to go behind, to go beyond; to call on}}
# {{lb|ru|used with verbs}} to [[begin]] doing {{gloss|describing an action of commencing}}
#: {{prefex|ru|говори́ть|g1=impf|t1=to speak|заговори́ть|g2=pf|t2=to begin to speak}}
# {{lb|ru|used with verbs}} [[in advance]] {{gloss|describing an action of doing something ahead of time}}
#: {{prefex|ru|гото́вить|g1=impf|t1=to prepare|загото́вить|g2=pf|t2=to prepare}}
# {{lb|ru|used with verbs}} {{n-g|perfectivizes verbs}}
#: {{prefex|ru|бетони́ровать|g1=impf|t1=to concrete|забетони́ровать|g2=pf|t2=to concrete}}
#: {{prefex|ru|по́лнить|g1=impf|t1=to fill|qq1=now archaic, not to be confused with {{m|ru|полни́ть}}|запо́лнить|g2=pf|t2=to fill}}
#: {{prefex|ru|асфальти́ровать|g1=impf|t1=to [[asphalt]], to [[resurface]]|заасфальти́ровать|g2=pf|t2=to [[asphalt]], to [[resurface]]}}
#: {{prefex|ru|бели́ть|g1=impf|t1=to [[whitewash]], to [[whiten]]|забели́ть|g2=pf|t2=to [[whitewash]], to [[whiten]]}}
# {{lb|ru|used with verbs}} to the [[finish]], to the [[end]] {{gloss|describing a completed result}}
#: {{prefex|ru|верши́ть|g1=impf|t1=to manage, control, direct|qq1=literary|заверши́ть|g2=pf|t2=to finish, complete, accomplish}}
# {{lb|ru|used with verbs}} {{n-g|describing an action of covering something, of being covered, or hiding behind something}}
#: {{prefex|ru|[[ржа́веть]], [[ржаве́ть]]|g1=impf|t1=to become rusty|[[заржа́веть]], [[заржаве́ть]]|g2=pf|t2=to become rusty {{q|as an emphasis, by being covered with rust}}}}
#: {{prefex|ru|целова́ть|g1=impf|t1=to kiss|зацелова́ть|g2=pf|t2=to cover with kisses {{gloss|denoting kissing many times, that one's body is fully covered with kisses}}}}
# {{lb|ru|used with verbs}} {{n-g|describing an intensified or extreme action or an action of doing something up to the point that an object becomes junk}}
#: {{prefex|ru|чита́ть|g1=impf|t1=to read|зачита́ть|g2=pf|t2=to read {{q|a book, as well as not returning it back; until it becomes all torn apart; simply reading out loud, denoting that the loud voice is a sign of intensified or extreme action}}}}
#: {{prefex|ru|сиде́ть|g1=impf|t1=to [[sit]]|засиде́ться|g2=pf|t2=to sit down, to stay for quite a long time {{gloss|denoting that the long duration of sitting is a sign of intensified or extreme action}}}}
#: {{prefex|ru|ду́мать|g1=impf|t1=to [[think]]|заду́мать|g2=pf|t2=to devise}}
# {{lb|ru|used with verbs}} {{n-g|describing an action that implies the existence of barriers, obstacles, or hindrance}}
#: {{prefex|ru|баллоти́ровать|g1=impf|t1=to vote (for someone)|забаллоти́ровать|g2=pf|t2=to fail to elect}}
#: {{prefex|ru|держа́ть|g1=impf|t1=to hold, keep, support|задержа́ть|g2=pf|t2=to detain, delay}}
# {{lb|ru|with a reflexive verb}} to do [[with]] [[abandonment]]
#: {{prefex|ru|говори́ть|g1=impf|t1=to [[speak]]|-ся|заговори́ться|g3=pf|t3=to spout nonsense; to rattle on; to have a long talk with, forgetting the time}}
# {{lb|ru|used with nouns, in place names}} [[trans-]]
#: {{prefex|ru|Карпа́ты|t1=[[Carpathians]]|-ье|Закарпа́тье|t3=Transcarpathia}}
#: {{prefex|ru|Кавка́з|t1=[[Caucasus]]|-ье|Закавка́зье|t3=Transcaucasia}}

====Usage notes====
* The stressed variant is found in the following situations:
*# the past participle of verbs with a one-syllable root ending in {{lang|ru|-ать}} and {{lang|ru|-нуть}}: e.g. {{m|ru|за́стланный}} from {{m|ru|застла́ть}}, {{m|ru|за́званный}} from {{m|ru|зазва́ть}}, {{m|ru|за́гнутый}} from {{m|ru|загну́ть}}, {{m|ru|за́мкнутый}} from {{m|ru|замкну́ть}};
*# the past tense of some verbs with a one-syllable root: e.g. {{m|ru|[[за́лил]], [[зали́л]]|pos=masculine singular past tense}} from {{m|ru|зали́ть||to [[flood]], to [[stain]], etc.}};
*# some deverbal nouns: e.g. {{m|ru|за́говор||[[conspiracy]]; [[charm]], [[spell]]}} from {{m|ru|заговори́ть||to [[charm]], to [[enchant]]}}, {{m|ru|за́морозки||[[light]] [[frost]]}} from {{m|ru|заморо́зить||to [[freeze]]}} + {{m|ru|-ок|-ки}}, {{m|ru|за́пись||[[recording]]}} from {{m|ru|записа́ть||to [[record]]}};
*# some adverbs: e.g. {{m|ru|за́мужем||[[married]] {{q|of a woman}}}}, {{m|ru|за́просто||[[without]] [[ceremony]] {{q|colloquial}}}}.

====Derived terms====
{{prefixsee|ru}}

